{
  "source": "maps/01-readers-path.excalidraw",
  "lang": "en",
  "strings": [
    {
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "text": "READING GUIDE",
      "translation": "ПУТЕВОДИТЕЛЬ ДЛЯ ЧИТАТЕЛЯ",
      "where": "free text"
    },
    {
      "id": "t_title",
      "text": "Three Routes Through the Book",
      "translation": "Три маршрута по книге",
      "where": "free text"
    },
    {
      "id": "t_sub",
      "text": "Same 10 chapters, three reader types. Each colored route marks where to start and what to skim.",
      "translation": "Те же 10 глав, три типа читателей. Каждый цветной маршрут показывает, где начать и что пролистать.",
      "where": "free text"
    },
    {
      "id": "leg_a_t",
      "text": "ROUTE A  ·  Senior / Staff Engineer",
      "translation": "МАРШРУТ A  ·  Старший инженер",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle leg_a",
      "budget_px": 367,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 38
    },
    {
      "id": "leg_a_d",
      "text": "Wants the hands-on scaffolding craft. Start at the\ntechnical core; skim the org and edge chapters.",
      "translation": "Нужно ремесло обвязки. Начните с технического\nядра; пролистайте главы об организации и пределах.",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle leg_a",
      "budget_px": 407,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "leg_b_t",
      "text": "ROUTE B  ·  Engineering Manager / CTO",
      "translation": "МАРШРУТ B  ·  Руководитель / CTO",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle leg_b",
      "budget_px": 367,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 38
    },
    {
      "id": "leg_b_d",
      "text": "Wants the operating-model shift. Start with the\nframing and org chapters; skim the deep internals.",
      "translation": "Нужен сдвиг в модели работы. Начните с постановки\nи организации; пролистайте глубокие детали.",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle leg_b",
      "budget_px": 407,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "leg_c_t",
      "text": "ROUTE C  ·  AI Product & Platform Lead",
      "translation": "МАРШРУТ C  ·  ИИ-продукт и платформа",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle leg_c",
      "budget_px": 367,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 38
    },
    {
      "id": "leg_c_d",
      "text": "Wants context, runtime, security and edges. Start\nmid-stack; skim taste and pure-coding chapters.",
      "translation": "Нужны контекст, среда исполнения, безопасность.\nНачните с середины; пролистайте вкус и код.",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle leg_c",
      "budget_px": 407,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "key_label",
      "text": "READING PRIORITY KEY     ●  read first / core      ◐  read in sequence      ○  skim or skip",
      "translation": "КЛЮЧ ПРИОРИТЕТОВ     ●  читать первой / ключевая      ◐  читать по порядку      ○  пролистать",
      "where": "free text"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_lbl",
      "text": "ACT I · THE PROBLEM",
      "translation": "АКТ I · ПРОБЛЕМА",
      "where": "free text"
    },
    {
      "id": "act2_lbl",
      "text": "ACT II · THE SCAFFOLDING STACK",
      "translation": "АКТ II · СТЕК ОБВЯЗКИ",
      "where": "free text"
    },
    {
      "id": "act3_lbl",
      "text": "ACT III · THE STRESS TEST",
      "translation": "АКТ III · СТРЕСС-ТЕСТ",
      "where": "free text"
    },
    {
      "id": "act4_lbl",
      "text": "ACT IV · THE WIDENING",
      "translation": "АКТ IV · РАСШИРЕНИЕ",
      "where": "free text"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch1_n",
      "text": "CHAPTER 1",
      "translation": "ГЛАВА 1",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch1",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "ch1_t",
      "text": "The Shift: From\nAssistant to Delegate",
      "translation": "Сдвиг: от ассистента\nк исполнителю",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch1",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "ch1_d",
      "text": "Frames the central question:\nwhat must be built before AI\nis trusted as a colleague.",
      "translation": "Ставит главный вопрос: что\nнужно построить, прежде чем\nдоверять ИИ как коллеге.",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch1",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "ch2_n",
      "text": "CHAPTER 2",
      "translation": "ГЛАВА 2",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch2",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "ch2_t",
      "text": "Taste Still Matters\nWhen Code Gets Cheap",
      "translation": "Вкус важен, даже\nкогда код дёшев",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch2",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "ch2_d",
      "text": "Re-establishes judgment and\narchitecture as the leveraged\nhuman role.",
      "translation": "Возвращает суждению и\nархитектуре роль главного\nрычага человека.",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch2",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "ch3_n",
      "text": "CHAPTER 3",
      "translation": "ГЛАВА 3",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch3",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "ch3_t",
      "text": "Harnesses, Specs &\nAgent-Ready Codebases",
      "translation": "Обвязки, спецификации\nи код для агентов",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch3",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "ch3_d",
      "text": "The technical hinge: agent\nquality depends on the\nengineered environment.",
      "translation": "Технический стержень: качество\nагента зависит от созданной\nсреды.",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch3",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "ch4_n",
      "text": "CHAPTER 4",
      "translation": "ГЛАВА 4",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch4",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "ch4_t",
      "text": "Evals Are the\nControl System",
      "translation": "Оценки — это\nсистема управления",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch4",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "ch4_d",
      "text": "Turns trust into continuous\nmeasurement aimed at real\nwork, not toy benchmarks.",
      "translation": "Превращает доверие в постоянное\nизмерение на реальной работе,\nа не на игрушечных бенчмарках.",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch4",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "ch5_n",
      "text": "CHAPTER 5",
      "translation": "ГЛАВА 5",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch5",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "ch5_t",
      "text": "Context Is\nInfrastructure",
      "translation": "Контекст — это\nинфраструктура",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch5",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "ch5_d",
      "text": "Retrieval, memory and\nassembly as infrastructure\nlayers, not prompt tricks.",
      "translation": "Поиск, память и сборка\nконтекста как слои\nинфраструктуры, а не трюки.",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch5",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "ch6_n",
      "text": "CHAPTER 6",
      "translation": "ГЛАВА 6",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch6",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "ch6_t",
      "text": "Runtimes, State & the\nHuman Control Plane",
      "translation": "Среда исполнения,\nсостояние и контроль\nчеловека",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch6",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "ch6_d",
      "text": "Durable execution and\ndesigned supervision for\nlong-running agents.",
      "translation": "Надёжное исполнение и\nпродуманный надзор для\nдолгих агентов.",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch6",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "ch7_n",
      "text": "CHAPTER 7",
      "translation": "ГЛАВА 7",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch7",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "ch7_t",
      "text": "Security, Identity &\nHigh-Stakes Trust",
      "translation": "Безопасность,\nидентичность, доверие\nпри высоких ставках",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch7",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "ch7_d",
      "text": "The governance cost of\nagency: identity, sandboxing,\nleast privilege, audit.",
      "translation": "Цена управления автономией:\nидентичность, песочница,\nминимум прав, аудит.",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch7",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "ch8_n",
      "text": "CHAPTER 8",
      "translation": "ГЛАВА 8",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch8",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "ch8_t",
      "text": "Realtime, Voice\n& the Cost of Being\nInterruptible",
      "translation": "Реальное время, голос\nи цена перебивания",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch8",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "ch8_d",
      "text": "Voice and streaming prove\nthe framework generalizes\nbeyond text-based coding.",
      "translation": "Голос и потоковая передача\nдоказывают, что подход\nработает не только для кода.",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch8",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "ch9_n",
      "text": "CHAPTER 9",
      "translation": "ГЛАВА 9",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch9",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "ch9_t",
      "text": "The AI-Native\nOrganization",
      "translation": "ИИ-нативная\nорганизация",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch9",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "ch9_d",
      "text": "Redesigning roles, incentives\nand interfaces around AI\nas a participant in the work.",
      "translation": "Новые роли, стимулы и\nинтерфейсы, где ИИ —\nучастник работы.",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch9",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "ch10_n",
      "text": "CHAPTER 10",
      "translation": "ГЛАВА 10",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch10",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "ch10_t",
      "text": "What Endures",
      "translation": "Что остаётся",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch10",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "ch10_d",
      "text": "Closes on the durable\nprinciples that survive\ntool churn.",
      "translation": "Итог: надёжные принципы,\nкоторые переживут смену\nинструментов.",
      "where": "free text inside rectangle ch10",
      "budget_px": 229,
      "budget_chars_per_line": 34
    },
    {
